      <section class="panel panel--started" data-section="started" data-chrome="dark" aria-label="A better way to build">
        <h2 class="started-title" aria-label="A better way to build">
          <span data-type-text="A better way"></span>
          <span data-type-text="to build"></span>
        </h2>
        <div class="started-steps">
          <article class="started-step">
            <canvas class="started-number" data-step-number="01" role="img" aria-label="01"></canvas>
            <h3>Your canvas,<br />your rules</h3>
            <p>Customize your canvas, pin what matters, and link projects to the folders and repos you're already working in.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="started-step">
            <canvas class="started-number" data-step-number="02" role="img" aria-label="02"></canvas>
            <h3>Build a crew,<br />not a chatbot</h3>
            <p>Build a cast of agents with real personalities and the skills to back them up — not just a name on a chat window.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="started-step">
            <canvas class="started-number" data-step-number="03" role="img" aria-label="03"></canvas>
            <h3>Stop switching<br />tools</h3>
            <p>Bring your chats, agents, and providers into one place that you actually own.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="started-step">
            <canvas class="started-number" data-step-number="04" role="img" aria-label="04"></canvas>
            <h3>Not married to<br />one model</h3>
            <p>Some tasks need the big brain. Most don't. Switch anytime and stop paying for power you don't need.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

